OL,3,GNEWSA'Milestone' decision on derelict
OL,4,Atown centre site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former industrial site in the heart
OL,7,Fof a town centre, which has been
OL,8,Fderelict for more than 30 years, will
OL,9,Fbe sold to an investment company.
OL,11,FSomerset Council announced real estate
OL,12,Finvestment managers Newcore Capital was
OL,13,Fits preferred buyer for the 12-acre
OL,14,FSaxonvale site in Frome, which it owns.
OL,16,FThe London-based company said it was
OL,17,F"delighted" and would "work closely
OL,18,Fwith the people of Frome" to develop
OL,19,Fplans for the site which could include
OL,20,Fhomes and community facilities.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
