OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 people attended the
OL,7,Fcouncil's meeting at Frome Town Hall
OL,8,Fsupporting an alternative,
OL,9,Fcommunity-led scheme put forward by
OL,10,Fsocial enterprise Mayday Saxonvale.
